# By the tower (found 2026-11-03 in greybox_look.steps: 30 fps facing its front from the low roof).
# Held Up from where you stand up, straight on (no turn taps: they made the line differ run to run),
# the run carries you over the crate, up the stairs, off the platform onto the low roof (64) and up
# to the tower's front. Stood still 2.5 s for each shot (fps and cpu are one-second averages):
# facing it, then turned left, then right. Check each shot for gaps too: the floor showing through
# the tower's front means its bottom was cut too high (cap_band_bottoms, level.c)
# Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps tower_perf.steps (built with BOOT_ON_FOOT 1)
wait_up
hold up 13
wait 2.5
shot tp_00_facing
hold left 0.3
wait 2.5
shot tp_01_left
hold right 0.6
wait 2.5
shot tp_02_right
hold right 0.3
wait 2.5
shot tp_03_right_more
